### IPP-1721 Admin -> Problems (hide / show / delete)
### Put ADMIN_PASSWORD while testing, then CHANGE_ME back.
### Run the steps in order. Step 4 needs the id of "two-sum" from step 2: copy it into @problemId.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@adminEmail = askedin143@gmail.com
@adminPassword = CHANGE_ME
@token = {{login.response.body.data.token}}
@problemId = {{list.response.body.$.data.problems[?(@.slug=='two-sum')]._id}}

### 1. Admin login -> 200
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{adminEmail}}", "password": "{{adminPassword}}" }


### 2. List -> 200, 13 problems, each with isActive, solvedCount, triedCount
# @name list
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/problems?language=javascript
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 3. Without login -> 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/problems?language=javascript


### 4. Hide -> 200 "Problem hidden", problem.isActive false
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/problems/{{problemId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isActive": false }


### 5. Public list -> "two-sum" is not in problems any more
GET {{baseUrl}}/problems?language=javascript


### 6. Admin can still open it -> 200, problem.isHidden true (guest gets 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/problems/javascript/two-sum
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 7. Import keeps it hidden: run "npm run import:problems -- javascript --yes", then repeat step 5 -> still not listed


### 8. Show again -> 200 "Problem is visible again"
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/problems/{{problemId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isActive": true }


### 9. Wrong body -> 400 "isActive must be true or false"
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/problems/{{problemId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isActive": "no" }


### 10. Delete -> 200 '"Two Sum" deleted', progressDeleted = number of users who tried it
###     (it comes back with the next import, because it is still in javascript.json)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/problems/{{problemId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 11. Delete again -> 404 "Problem not found"
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/problems/{{problemId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
